OL,5,G2305 Naked Attraction
OL,6,     FIn the Naked Attraction studio,
OL,7,     Fformer club rep Chris hopes to
OL,8,     Fmeet someone to settle down with.
OL,9,     FTechnophobe Louise wants an
OL,10,     Fold-fashioned gentleman to sweep
OL,11,     Fher off her feet.
OL,12,G0005 First Dates
OL,13,     FAryeh seeks a man who can handle
OL,14,     Fhis big personality. Meryl, a
OL,15,     F60-year-old widow, wants someone
OL,16,     F'with a pulse' who can keep up
OL,17,     Fwith her clubbing. Two sisters try
OL,18,     Fdouble dating.
